ersion\n  2683\tsemantics, the numeric hash modulus, the integer-text conversion\n  2684\tpolicy, the admitted numeric limits, and the required pure modules and\n  2685\tboundary adapters; resource checks use portable quantities such as bit\n  2686\tlengths and digit counts, never host object sizes or available memory\n  2687\t(section 8.5.4). A prelude that grows, as C2's does, changes every\n  2688\tbundled unit's address and is a prelude-profile bump.\n  2689\t\n  2690\tCross-host content-address claims remain conditional on the canonical\n  2691\tencoding actually used. The disclosed `dao.jing` encoding residuals\n  2692\trequire explicit conformance tests and profile restrictions or fixes;\n  2693\tthis document does not silently replace its addressing scheme.\n  2694\t\n  2695\t---\n  2696\t\n  2697\t## 12. Phased roadmap\n  2698\t\nrg: src/cljc/yang/python/prelude.cljc: No such file or directory (os error 2)\nsrc/cljc/yang/php.cljc:96:                         :clj (Double/parseDouble val)\nsrc/cljc/yang/php.cljc:97:                         :cljs (js/parseFloat val))\nsrc/cljc/yang/python.cljc:111:                         :clj (Double/parseDouble val)\nsrc/cljc/yang/python.cljc:112:                         :cljs (js/parseFloat val))\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:280:                                         :clj (Double/parseDouble t)\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:281:                                         :cljs (js/parseFloat t))}\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:19:                     so 1, 1.0 and True are one key\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:89:    [py/float (fn [x] (assoc {} :py/float (* 1.0 x)))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:862:     ;; -0.0 is built as (* -1.0 0.0): ClojureDart compiles one-argument\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:863:     ;; `-` to (0 - x), and 0 - 0.0 is +0.0; multiplying by -1.0 negates\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:865:     (fn [y] (if (< y 0) (* -1.0 0.0) 0.0))